  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AJYAL IS A LEADING NON-GOVERNMENTAL ORGANIZATION IN THE FIELD OF EMPOWERING YOUTH AND CHILDREN IN THE GAZA STRIP.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ajyal is a leading non-governmental organization in the field of empowering youth and children in the Gaza Strip. Ajyal seeks to improve the lives of young people who face double marginalization and enable them to play a positive role in the development of Palestinian society. Ajyal was established in 2003 and registered with the Ministry of Interior under registration number 7329. It aims to contribute to the development of Palestinian society by providing a series of innovative interventions and pioneering projects. With more than 18 years of practical experience, Ajyal has succeeded in establishing many partnerships with international and local organizations and achieving the desired change at the individual and societal levels.</narrative>
  </description>
